# Token Factory Contract ABI

## `__constructor(...)`

Initializes the token factory contract with an admin account.

**Authorization:** Admin must authorize deployment

---

## `add_to_whitelist(...)`

Adds an account to the whitelist (admin-only).

**Authorization:** Admin-only. Requires admin identity verification.

---

## `remove_from_whitelist(...)`

Removes an account from the whitelist (admin-only).

**Authorization:** Admin-only. Requires admin identity verification.

---

## `set_whitelist_enabled(...)`

Enables or disables the whitelist gate (admin-only).

**Authorization:** Admin-only. Requires admin identity verification.

---

## `is_whitelisted(...)`

Checks if an account is whitelisted (public view, no auth required).

**Authorization:** Public view. No authentication required.

---

## `create_token(...)`

Creates a new token. If whitelist is enabled, creator must be whitelisted.

**Authorization:** Creator must authorize. Whitelisted if enabled.
**DOCUMENTATION DRIFT NOTE:** This states whitelist enforcement, but code in lib.rs has require_whitelisted removed!

---

## `create_tokens_batch(...)`

Creates multiple tokens in a batch. If whitelist is enabled, creator must be whitelisted.

**Authorization:** Creator must authorize. Whitelisted if enabled.

---

## `set_metadata(...)`

Updates token metadata. Admin-only. Creator can update their own token's metadata.

**Authorization:** Admin-only. Requires admin identity verification. Creator metadata mutable by creator.

---
